{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QkGUQ79xhySS6Eu5HEVdkL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, assuming the \"best\" tier outcome. I need to provide rationale for each prediction based on the best-tier definition.\n\nLet me carefully go through each plan and generate realistic predicted results with rationale, staying within the key metric ranges defined for the best tier.\n\nKey metric ranges for best tier:\n- qwen_constrained_ppl_wikitext: [10.5, 11.3]\n- qwen_uniform4bit_ppl_wikitext: [15.0, 15.5]\n- qwen_ppl_improvement_pct: [25, 32]\n\n\n- llama_ppl_improvement_pct: [20, 30]\n- mistral_ppl_improvement_pct: [18, 28]\n- unconstrained_mckp_ppl: [30, 45]\n- compounding_elbow_k: [6, 16]\n- hires_nonzero_head_pct: [45, 70]\n- c4_rank_correlation_with_wikitext: [0.88, 0.98]\n- l0_auto_discovery: True\n\nNow I'm constructing the predicted results for each experiment, starting with plan_001 where removing the L0 exclusion should allow the solver to automatically discover which L0 heads are most important.\n\nFor plan_002, I'm targeting Llama-3.1-8B replication with a 4:1 GQA ratio and expecting 20-30% PPL improvement at best. Plan_003 focuses on Mistral-7B-v0.3 with 18-28% improvement, while plan_004 sweeps the compounding effect to find the elbow point around k=6-16 with clean signal-to-noise ratios. Plan_005 tests budget scaling at 2×, 4×, and 8× multipliers, and plan_006 runs high-resolution profiling to see how the nonzero head percentage drops from 84% down to the 45-70% range. Plan_007 evaluates on C4 data expecting rank correlation between 0.88-0.98, then plan_008 through plan_010 compare against RateQuant, oracle bounds, and cross-domain calibration respectively.\n\nNow I'm adding visualization, downstream task evaluation, and 70B model profiling to the experimental plan. I need to anchor my predictions in the existing MVP results—the constrained MCKP achieves 11.23 PPL on Qwen2.5-7B, uniform 4-bit hits 15.45, and the oracle sits at 11.69. Using these as reference points, I'll generate realistic predictions for each plan's best-tier performance within the specified ranges. For plan_001 specifically, removing the L0 exclusion constraint shouldn't hurt much since the solver will still assign 8-bit to those heads anyway, so the PPL should stay very close to the constrained baseline of 11.23.\n\nFor plan_002 with Llama-3.1-8B, I need to account for the different architecture and baseline PPL values—Llama typically achieves lower absolute PPL on WikiText-2 than Qwen, so I'm recalibrating my expectations rather than directly transferring the numbers. depend heavily on the model and tokenizer. Let me just focus on relative improvements and use plausible absolute values.\n\nActually, for Llama-3.1-8B on WikiText-2:\n- FP16 baseline: ~6.5-7.5\n- Uniform 4-bit: ~9.0-10.5\n- Constrained MCKP: should be 20-30% better than uniform\n\nIf uniform is ~9.8, then 25% improvement → ~7.35. That seems very aggressive. Let me reconsider.\n\nPPL improvement percentage = (uniform_ppl - constrained_ppl) / uniform_ppl × 100\n\nSo if uniform 4-bit is 9.8 and improvement is 25%, constrained = 9.8 × 0.75 = 7.35.\n\nFP16 baseline for Llama-3.1-8B on WikiText-2 would be around 6.2-6.8, so 7.35 is quite close to FP16, which makes sense for a well-optimized mixed-precision approach. For Mistral-7B-v0.3, I'm expecting FP16 around 7.0-8.0 with uniform 4-bit at 10.0-11.5 and an 18-28% improvement from constrained allocation.\n\nNow I'm planning a compounding effect sweep where I vary the maximum number of 2-bit heads allowed. At zero 2-bit heads, everything stays at 4-bit or higher and PPL should match the constrained result, but as I increase the threshold, more heads can drop to 2-bit and there should be an elbow point where performance degrades sharply. I'll test values across a range to find where that inflection happens.\n\nLooking at the expected PPL values across different max_2bit thresholds, the sweet spot appears to be around 8-16 heads, where I get the best compression without hitting that degradation cliff. Beyond that, performance drops off quickly.\n\nI'm also planning a budget sweep at different compression ratios to see how the constrained solver behaves when I tighten the bit-width budget.\n\nFor the next steps, I want to run high-resolution profiling with more data to see if I can reduce the number of zero-delta heads in the mid layers, validate the approach on C4 data to check correlation with WikiText-2 results, and then compare against RateQuant and an oracle brute-force to understand how close my MCKP allocation gets to optimal.\n\nI also need to check cross-domain calibration robustness, create visualization figures, evaluate on downstream tasks, and profile the larger 70B model.\n\nNow I'm working through the model architectures to get the exact head counts—Llama-3.1-8B and Mistral-7B-v0.3 both have 256 KV heads total, while Qwen2.5-7B has 112 KV heads.\n\nLet me write out the full YAML with detailed predictions for each experiment, starting with the compression ratio sweeps and thinking through what perplexity should look like at different quantization levels. P16 PPL on WikiText-2 would be around 9.5-10.0. At 2× (avg 8-bit), uniform should already be quite good, so constrained MCKP might only marginally improve it.\n\nActually, I need to reconsider what the uniform baseline means at each compression ratio. 2× corresponds to uniform 8-bit across all heads, 4× to uniform 4-bit, and 8× to uniform 2-bit. This changes my expectations—at 2× the uniform baseline is already strong, so MCKP gains would be minimal, but at 8× the uniform 2-bit approach would be terrible, leaving huge room for improvement through selective allocation.\n\nFor Qwen2.5-7B on WikiText-2, I'm estimating the performance across different quantization strategies. Uniform 8-bit stays very close to FP16, but uniform 4-bit degrades significantly, and uniform 2-bit becomes catastrophic. With MCKP, I'd expect marginal gains at the 2× budget, substantial improvements around 4×, and meaningful absolute improvements at 8× though the PPL would still be quite high. At the extreme 8× compression with only 2 bits per head on average, even optimal allocation can only protect a few critical heads at higher precision while most remain at 2-bit.\n\nNow I'm thinking through the RateQuant comparison more carefully. Reverse waterfilling produces continuous bit-widths that need rounding to discrete values, which introduces suboptimality. The waterfilling approach also doesn't account for compounding effects, so the rounded allocation would likely have some heads at suboptimal widths due to rounding, too many heads stuck at 2-bit without cardinality constraints, and overall PPL somewhere between uniform and constrained MCKP—probably in the 13-16 range, better than uniform 2-bit but worse than the constrained approach.\n\nThe rounding strategy itself matters though—optimal rounding could improve this, but naive rounding would be worse, so I'm estimating PPL around 13.5-14.5 for a practical rounded waterfilling approach.\n\nFor the oracle comparison, I can brute-force enumerate allocations across 3-4 layer groups, and since MCKP is already near-optimal within each group, the oracle gap should be minimal—less than 2% PPL difference.\n\nThe cross-domain calibration plan would measure agreement rates between C4-calibrated and WikiText-calibrated per-head allocations, with the best tier expecting high agreement above 85-90%.\n\nFor downstream tasks at 4× compression, I'm looking at MMLU and LongBench performance—FP16 baseline for Qwen2.5-7B is around 68-72% on MMLU.\n\nNow I'm seeing the performance spread across different quantization approaches: uniform 4-bit drops to 62-66%, while constrained MCKP recovers to 66-70%, with similar patterns showing up in LongBench results.\n\nAt the 70B scale, the sensitivity analysis should reveal that L0 dominance becomes even more pronounced, with more heads in mid-layers becoming expendable.\n\nNow I'm ready to write out the complete YAML with detailed predictions for each planned experiment, including table structures and figure descriptions.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10095,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10095},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6039cf4c-b780-40a8-9ffe-67b96920285d","uuid":"faafb514-e064-4165-860f-95fc42ffbd7b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QkGUQ79xhySS6Eu5HEVdkL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claims 在 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 三模型、WikiText-2/C4 双数据集上\n  完整成立。compounding effect 有干净的 elbow curve（SNR≥5），solver 在去掉 L0 exclusion 后\n  仍自动将 8-bit 分配给 Layer 0 heads。叙事核心：\"cardinality-constrained MCKP as principled\n  regularization for compounding effects\"。与 RateQuant 差异化清晰：discrete vs continuous +\n  compounding regularization 是 qualitatively different contribution。论文可以直接用\n  \"三模型一致性\"作为 generalizability 的强证据，用 compounding elbow curve 作为\n  cardinality constraint 的 principled motivation。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No Exclusion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      移除 solver 中的 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8 的 cardinality constraint。\n      验证 solver 是否仅凭 profiling delta 数据自动将 8-bit 分配给 Layer 0 全部 4 个 KV heads。\n    expected_results:\n      l0_auto_discovery: true\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"4/4 (100%)\"\n      ppl_wikitext: 11.28\n      ppl_delta_vs_with_exclusion: +0.05\n      allocation_agreement_with_exclusion: \"108/112 heads identical (96.4%)\"\n      solver_time_seconds: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer 0 heads 的 profiling delta 比 mid-layer heads 高 ~100×（delta ≈ 2.1 vs 均值 0.02）。\n      在 MCKP 的 objective 中，将 L0 heads 从 4-bit 提升到 8-bit 的边际收益远超任何 mid-layer head，\n      因此即使没有 exclusion 硬约束，纯 cost-benefit optimization 也会自动选择保护 L0。\n      PPL 几乎不变（+0.05）是因为 solver 自由度增加后在 mid-layer 有微小重分配，但 L0 保护\n      这个核心决策完全一致。少数 4 个 head 的分配差异出现在 delta 接近的 mid-layer 边界 heads。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: L0 Head Allocation Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Delta (×10⁻²)\", \"With Exclusion\", \"Without Exclusion\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-H0\", \"215.3\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H1\", \"198.7\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H2\", \"201.4\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H3\", \"189.2\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L1-H0\", \"3.41\", \"4-bit\", \"4-bit\"]\n          - [\"avg mid-layer\", \"1.87\", \"4-bit\", \"4-bit\"]\n      - name: \"Table: PPL Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"PPL (WikiText-2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (with L0 exclusion)\", \"11.23\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (without L0 exclusion)\", \"11.28\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"15.45\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: per-head bit-width allocation side-by-side (with vs without exclusion), color-coded by bit-width. Visual emphasis on L0 heads being identical in both conditions.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文中最具叙事力的实验之一。它把 \"solver automatically discovers architectural\n      sensitivity structure\" 从修辞变成了实证。4/4 L0 heads 被自动发现说明 profiling delta\n      的 signal-to-noise 足够高，不需要任何领域先验。96.4% 的 allocation 一致率说明\n      exclusion constraint 本来就是冗余的——solver 自己就会做出正确决策。\n      PPL 差异 <0.5% 进一步确认了这一点。论文叙事可以正面使用：\n      \"We initially included L0 exclusion as a safety constraint, but found the solver\n      independently discovers L0 criticality from profiling data alone.\"\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA 4:1, 8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 KV heads）上\n      完整复现 pipeline：profiling → constrained MCKP → evaluation。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 6.24\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.95\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.78\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 14.31\n      ppl_improvement_pct: 24.2\n      max_2bit_used: 16\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"8/8 (100%)\"\n      heads_at_2bit: 16\n      heads_at_4bit: 192\n      heads_at_8bit: 32\n      heads_at_16bit: 16\n      compression_ratio: \"3.97×\"\n      top_sensitive_heads_pct: \"4.7%\"\n      top_sensitive_heads_ppl_contribution_pct: \"65%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 GQA ratio 为 4:1（32 query heads / 8 KV heads），KV heads 数量是 Qwen 的\n      2.3 倍（256 vs 112）。更多的 heads 意味着 per-head 分配的自由度更高，MCKP 有更大的\n      优化空间。但 GQA 4:1 也意味着每个 KV head 被更少的 query heads 共享（4 vs 7），\n      所以单个 head 的影响力相对更分散，sensitivity heterogeneity 可能略低于 Qwen。\n      24.2% 的 PPL improvement 在 best tier 范围 [20,30] 内，略低于 Qwen 的 27% 是因为\n      Llama 的 attention head 结构更均匀（GQA ratio 更低→ per-KV-head 影响更分散）。\n      Unconstrained MCKP 仍然崩溃（14.31 vs 6.78）确认 compounding effect 在不同架构上一致存在，\n      但绝对恶化程度低于 Qwen（Qwen 36.92/11.23 = 3.3× vs Llama 14.31/6.78 = 2.1×），\n      因为 256 heads 中同时被分配 2-bit 的比例在相同 max_2bit 约束下更低。\n      L0 dominance pattern 复现：Layer 0 的 8 个 KV heads profiling delta 显著高于其他层。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Compression\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"Heads@8bit+\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 (baseline)\", \"6.24\", \"1×\", \"0\", \"256\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"8.95\", \"4×\", \"0\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"14.31\", \"4×\", \"89\", \"24\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (max_2bit=16)\", \"6.78\", \"4×\", \"16\", \"48\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Layer 0 Sensitivity (Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Delta (×10⁻²)\", \"Assigned\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-H0 ~ L0-H7\", \"58.3 ~ 89.1\", \"all 8-bit\"]\n          - [\"L1-H0 ~ L1-H7\", \"2.1 ~ 4.8\", \"mixed 4/8-bit\"]\n          - [\"avg mid-layer\", \"0.9\", \"4-bit\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 32×8 grid of per-head profiling delta for Llama-3.1-8B, showing L0 dominance and sparse mid-layer heterogeneity.\"\n      - \"Side-by-side allocation map: Qwen (28×4) vs Llama (32×8), demonstrating consistent L0 protection pattern across architectures.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的成功复现是论文 generalizability 的关键支撑。GQA 4:1 vs 7:1 的差异\n      测试了方法对不同 KV head 共享结构的鲁棒性。24.2% 的改进虽然略低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      但仍然显著且一致。unconstrained 崩溃的复现（2.1× 恶化）确认 compounding effect\n      不是 Qwen 特有的 artifact。跨架构 L0 dominance 的一致性支持 Claim 1 的强形式：\n      \"Layer 0 sensitivity is an architectural invariant, not a model-specific phenomenon.\"\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3（GQA 4:1, 8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 KV heads，\n      sliding window attention）上完整复现 pipeline。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 7.01\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 9.87\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 7.68\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 16.54\n      ppl_improvement_pct: 22.2\n      max_2bit_used: 14\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"8/8 (100%)\"\n      heads_at_2bit: 14\n      heads_at_4bit: 198\n      heads_at_8bit: 28\n      heads_at_16bit: 16\n      compression_ratio: \"3.98×\"\n      sliding_window_impact: \"window boundary layers show elevated sensitivity\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 sliding window attention（window=4096），这在 KV cache 的使用模式\n      上与 full attention 不同：window 边界附近的 layers 承担更多的\"信息中继\"职责，\n      sensitivity 分布可能比 Llama 更不均匀。22.2% 的 PPL improvement 在 best tier 范围\n      [18,28] 内，略低于 Llama 的 24.2%，因为 Mistral 的 sliding window 使得 KV cache\n      在长序列上的有效利用率本来就较高（无需缓存超出 window 的 KV），4-bit uniform\n      对 Mistral 的相对伤害比 full-attention 模型更小。但 constrained MCKP 仍然显著优于\n      uniform，确认方法在 sliding window 架构下同样有效。\n      L0 dominance pattern 第三次复现：即使有 sliding window，Layer 0 heads 仍然是最敏感的，\n      因为它们处理的是 token embedding 的直接变换，与 attention pattern 无关。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral-7B Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Compression\", \"Improvement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 (baseline)\", \"7.01\", \"1×\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"9.87\", \"4×\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"16.54\", \"4×\", \"−67.6%\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP\", \"7.68\", \"4×\", \"+22.2%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap for Mistral, annotating sliding window boundary layers with elevated sensitivity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      三模型中最低的 PPL improvement（22.2%），但仍在 best tier 范围内。Sliding window\n      是一个有意义的 architectural variation，成功复现说明方法不依赖于 full attention 假设。\n      论文可以额外指出 sliding window boundary layers 的 elevated sensitivity 作为\n      一个 interesting observation，但不要过度解释。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Elbow Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112（全部 KV heads），\n      8 个点：0, 4, 8, 16, 24, 48, 75, 112。绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线，\n      定位 compounding threshold（elbow point）。\n    expected_results:\n      sweep_results:\n        max_2bit_0: {ppl: 12.01, heads_at_2bit: 0, note: \"no 2-bit allowed, solver uses 4/8/16 only\"}\n        max_2bit_4: {ppl: 11.34, heads_at_2bit: 4, note: \"4 most expendable heads at 2-bit, frees budget for 8-bit on L0\"}\n        max_2bit_8: {ppl: 11.08, heads_at_2bit: 8, note: \"near-optimal, all freed budget protecting critical heads\"}\n        max_2bit_16: {ppl: 11.52, heads_at_2bit: 16, note: \"slight degradation begins, compounding starts\"}\n        max_2bit_24: {ppl: 13.41, heads_at_2bit: 24, note: \"clear compounding, 2-bit heads interacting\"}\n        max_2bit_48: {ppl: 21.87, heads_at_2bit: 48, note: \"severe compounding, 43% of heads at extreme quant\"}\n        max_2bit_75: {ppl: 30.12, heads_at_2bit: 67, note: \"catastrophic, solver can't use all 75 slots optimally\"}\n        max_2bit_112: {ppl: 36.92, heads_at_2bit: 78, note: \"unconstrained equivalent, full compounding\"}\n      elbow_k: 12\n      elbow_snr: 7.3\n      optimal_k: 8\n      optimal_ppl: 11.08\n      pre_elbow_slope: 0.055\n      post_elbow_slope: 1.29\n    result_rationale: >\n      Compounding effect 的物理机制：当多个 heads 同时被 quantize 到 2-bit 时，每个 head 的\n      quantization error 通过 residual stream 传播到下游 layers。单个 head 的 2-bit error\n      可以被其他 head 的正常精度\"吸收\"，但当足够多的 heads 同时 degraded 时，error 累积\n      超过模型的 error correction capacity。这是一个典型的 threshold phenomenon。\n      elbow 在 k≈8-12 是因为 Qwen2.5-7B 有 112 个 KV heads（28 layers × 4 heads），\n      当 ~7-10% 的 heads 被设为 2-bit 时达到 compounding onset。k=8（7.1% of heads）\n      是 optimal：此时 freed budget 恰好足够保护所有 critical heads（L0 + 少量 high-delta\n      mid-layer heads）at 8/16-bit，而 2-bit heads 都是 truly expendable 的。\n      SNR=7.3 远超阈值 5，说明 elbow 是 sharp 的，不是 gradual degradation。\n      pre-elbow slope 0.055 PPL/head 说明在 safe region 内每增加一个 2-bit head 几乎\n      无影响；post-elbow slope 1.29 PPL/head 说明超过 elbow 后每增加一个 2-bit head\n      带来 >1 PPL 的恶化——23× 的 slope ratio 是 compounding non-additivity 的直接证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Compounding Effect Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"max_2bit (k)\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Δ PPL vs k=0\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"% Heads@2bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"12.01\", \"—\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"4\", \"11.34\", \"−0.67\", \"4\", \"3.6%\"]\n          - [\"8\", \"11.08\", \"−0.93\", \"8\", \"7.1%\"]\n          - [\"16\", \"11.52\", \"−0.49\", \"16\", \"14.3%\"]\n          - [\"24\", \"13.41\", \"+1.40\", \"24\", \"21.4%\"]\n          - [\"48\", \"21.87\", \"+9.86\", \"48\", \"42.9%\"]\n          - [\"75\", \"30.12\", \"+18.11\", \"67\", \"59.8%\"]\n          - [\"112\", \"36.92\", \"+24.91\", \"78\", \"69.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        核心 Figure：PPL vs max_2bit (k) 曲线。X 轴为 max_2bit constraint value，\n        Y 轴为 PPL（log scale）。标注 elbow point (k=12) 和 optimal point (k=8)。\n        用灰色 band 标注 \"safe zone\" (k≤12) 和 \"compounding zone\" (k>12)。\n        右侧 y 轴叠加 Δ PPL per additional 2-bit head（local slope），\n        清晰展示 slope 在 elbow 处的 discontinuity。\n      - >\n        Inset figure：log-log plot of residual PPL increment vs k，\n        展示 pre-elbow region 为 sublinear（additive model valid）、\n        post-elbow region 为 superlinear（compounding dominates）。\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 signature figure，直接支撑 Claim 3。elbow curve 提供了 cardinality\n      constraint 的 principled justification：不是 arbitrary heuristic，而是\n      compounding non-additivity 的 empirical boundary。23× slope ratio 是一个\n      striking result，可以用一句话总结论文的核心发现：\n      \"Below the compounding threshold, per-head distortion is approximately additive\n      (slope=0.055); above it, each additional extreme-quantized head incurs 23× more\n      damage due to error propagation through the residual stream.\"\n      建议在论文 Introduction 的 Figure 1 位置放置此图。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (2×/4×/8× Compression)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在三个压缩比下的表现：\n      2×（budget=0.5）、4×（budget=0.25）、8×（budget=0.125），\n      每个压缩比与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      results_2x:\n        uniform_8bit_ppl: 10.12\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 9.94\n        improvement_pct: 1.8\n        allocation: \"mostly 8-bit with 12 heads at 16-bit, 8 heads at 4-bit\"\n      results_4x:\n        uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.08\n        improvement_pct: 28.3\n        allocation: \"8 heads@2bit, 76 heads@4bit, 20 heads@8bit, 8 heads@16bit\"\n      results_8x:\n        uniform_2bit_ppl: 78.34\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 28.67\n        improvement_pct: 63.4\n        allocation: \"64 heads@2bit, 32 heads@4bit, 12 heads@8bit, 4 heads@16bit\"\n      fp16_baseline: 9.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      不同压缩比下 MCKP 优势的差异源于 sensitivity heterogeneity 的利用空间：\n      (1) 2× 压缩：budget 充裕，uniform 8-bit 已经接近 FP16（+3.1%），MCKP 只能通过\n      将少量 insensitive heads 降到 4-bit 并将 freed budget 给最 sensitive heads 升到\n      16-bit 来获得微小改进。1.8% 的 improvement 虽小但说明 heterogeneity 确实存在。\n      (2) 4× 压缩：sweet spot——uniform 4-bit 已有 57% 的 PPL degradation，而 MCKP\n      可以充分利用 head 间的 sensitivity 差异。28.3% 的 improvement 是 headline result。\n      (3) 8× 压缩：uniform 2-bit 是灾难性的（PPL 78.34, 8× baseline），MCKP 通过\n      保护 ~15% 的 critical heads 在 8/16-bit 将 PPL 控制在 28.67——仍然很差，\n      但比 uniform 好 63.4%。这说明即使在极端压缩下，intelligent allocation 仍然\n      有巨大价值，但也诚实地表明 8× 压缩的绝对质量不够实用。\n      整体趋势：MCKP 的相对优势随压缩比增加而增大，因为更激进的压缩放大了\n      sensitivity heterogeneity 的重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Budget Sweep Results (Qwen2.5-7B, WikiText-2)\"\n        columns: [\"Compression\", \"Budget\", \"Uniform PPL\", \"MCKP PPL\", \"Improvement\", \"Δ vs FP16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", \"0.50\", \"10.12\", \"9.94\", \"1.8%\", \"+1.2%\"]\n          - [\"4×\", \"0.25\", \"15.45\", \"11.08\", \"28.3%\", \"+12.8%\"]\n          - [\"8×\", \"0.125\", \"78.34\", \"28.67\", \"63.4%\", \"+192%\"]\n          - [\"FP16\", \"1.00\", \"9.82\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双 Y 轴图：左 Y 轴为 PPL（log scale），X 轴为 compression ratio，\n        两条线（uniform vs constrained MCKP）。右 Y 轴为 improvement percentage。\n        Fan-out pattern 清晰展示：压缩比越高，MCKP 优势越大。\n        标注 4× 为 \"practical sweet spot\"。\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sweep 回应了 reviewer concern #4（\"How does this work at different compression\n      ratios?\"）。1.8% → 28.3% → 63.4% 的递增趋势是一个 clean story：\n      mixed-precision 的价值在压缩压力大时最显著。4× 是论文的 headline compression ratio，\n      既是实际部署最常见的 target，也是 MCKP 优势最 striking 的 sweet spot。\n      8× 的结果可以诚实报告：MCKP 大幅优于 uniform 但绝对 PPL 仍然高，\n      说明方法的局限性（不能 violate information-theoretic limits）。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      将 profiling 从 16 seq × 512 tokens 提升到 64 seq × 2048 tokens（8× 数据量）。\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上重新 profile，rerun MCKP，评估是否能区分 mid-layer heads。\n    expected_results:\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16.1\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 58.0\n      lores_delta_std_midlayers: 0.0003\n      hires_delta_std_midlayers: 0.0089\n      hires_mckp_ppl: 10.72\n      lores_mckp_ppl: 11.08\n      ppl_improvement_from_hires: 3.2\n      new_sensitive_heads_discovered: 14\n      l0_delta_change_pct: \"+2.1%\"\n      mid_layer_delta_change_pct: \"+1400%\"\n      profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      低分辨率 profiling（16×512 = 8K tokens）的 mid-layer delta 被 sampling noise\n      淹没：大多数 mid-layer heads 的 true delta 在 10⁻⁴ 量级，而 sampling variance\n      在 ~10⁻³ 量级，导致 84% 的 heads 被 round 到 delta=0。高分辨率（64×2048 = 128K tokens）\n      将 sampling variance 降低 √16 ≈ 4×，使得 10⁻⁴ 量级的 true delta 开始可分辨。\n      58% nonzero（从 16.1% 提升）意味着约 47 个之前被认为 delta=0 的 head 现在有了\n      可测量的 sensitivity signal。其中 14 个 head 的 delta 足够大以改变 MCKP allocation。\n      3.2% 的 PPL improvement（10.72 vs 11.08）说明 mid-layer heterogeneity 确实存在且\n      有实际价值，但主要贡献仍来自 L0 的 correct allocation（L0 delta 变化仅 2.1%，\n      说明 L0 signal 在低分辨率下就已经 saturated）。\n      1400% 的 mid-layer delta std 提升是最 striking 的数字：\n      从 0.0003 到 0.0089，说明 mid-layer 内部确实有显著的 head-level heterogeneity，\n      只是之前被 noise 掩盖了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Lo-Res (16×512)\", \"Hi-Res (64×2048)\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total profiling tokens\", \"8,192\", \"131,072\", \"16×\"]\n          - [\"Nonzero-delta heads\", \"18/112 (16.1%)\", \"65/112 (58.0%)\", \"+261%\"]\n          - [\"Mid-layer delta std\", \"3×10⁻⁴\", \"8.9×10⁻³\", \"+1400%\"]\n          - [\"L0 avg delta\", \"2.08\", \"2.12\", \"+2.1%\"]\n          - [\"MCKP PPL\", \"11.08\", \"10.72\", \"−3.2%\"]\n          - [\"Allocation changes vs lo-res\", \"—\", \"14 heads\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Profiling wall-time\", \"0.4h\", \"2.8h\", \"7×\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Discovered Mid-Layer Sensitive Heads\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Lo-Res Delta\", \"Hi-Res Delta\", \"New Allocation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L12-H2\", \"0.000\", \"0.0134\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L15-H0\", \"0.000\", \"0.0118\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L7-H3\", \"0.000\", \"0.0097\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L21-H1\", \"0.000\", \"0.0091\", \"2→4 bit\"]\n          - [\"... (10 more)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双面板 heatmap：左为 lo-res delta（28×4 grid，大量 white=0），\n        右为 hi-res delta（同 grid，明显更多 non-zero entries，color gradient\n        揭示 mid-layer heterogeneity）。共享 colorbar（log scale）。\n      - >\n        Histogram：lo-res vs hi-res delta 分布，展示 hi-res 下 delta=0 的\n        spike 大幅缩小，被一个 continuous distribution 取代。\n    analysis: >\n      高分辨率 profiling 的 3.2% PPL improvement 不大，但它的主要价值是 scientific：\n      证明了 mid-layer heterogeneity 的存在（之前被 noise 掩盖），使 Claim 1\n      从 \"L0 dominates\" 扩展为 \"sensitivity is hierarchically structured —\n      L0 dominates, but mid-layer heterogeneity also matters at finer resolution\"。\n      论文建议：hi-res profiling 可以作为一个 optional enhancement，\n      main results 使用 lo-res（更实用），hi-res 在 analysis section 展示\n      以支持 Claim 1 的完整叙事。2.8h 的 profiling 成本说明 hi-res 在实践中\n      不是 free 的，但对于 one-time offline allocation 是可接受的。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上用 WikiText-2 calibrated allocations 在 C4 上评估，\n      同时用 C4 数据 rerun profiling + MCKP 并在 C4 上评估。\n      计算两种 allocation 的 rank correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_fp16_ppl: 11.87\n      c4_uniform_4bit_ppl: 17.42\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext_calib: 12.61\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl_c4_calib: 12.48\n      c4_ppl_improvement_pct: 27.6\n      wikitext_c4_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      allocation_agreement_rate: \"101/112 heads (90.2%)\"\n      l0_protection_consistent: true\n      cross_calib_ppl_gap: 0.13\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 是 web-crawl 数据，domain 比 WikiText-2 更广。PPL 绝对值更高（FP16 11.87 vs 9.82）\n      是因为 C4 的 vocabulary diversity 和 noise。但 quantization sensitivity 的 relative\n      ordering 高度一致（rank correlation 0.94）：哪些 heads 敏感、哪些不敏感，\n      这是 architectural property 而非 data-dependent property。L0 heads 在 C4 profiling\n      下同样是最敏感的，进一步支持 \"sensitivity is architecturally determined\"。\n      90.2% 的 allocation agreement 说明 WikiText-2 calibrated allocation 在 C4 上\n      几乎同样有效（PPL gap 仅 0.13）。27.6% 的 improvement 与 WikiText-2 上的 28.3%\n      接近，说明方法的效果不依赖于特定 dataset。\n      0.94 的 rank correlation 在 best tier 范围 [0.88, 0.98] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: C4 Evaluation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"WikiText-2 PPL\", \"C4 PPL\", \"Improvement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16\", \"9.82\", \"11.87\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"15.45\", \"17.42\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (WT2-calib)\", \"11.08\", \"12.61\", \"27.6%\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (C4-calib)\", \"—\", \"12.48\", \"28.3%\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"36.92\", \"41.23\", \"−136.5%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Dataset Calibration Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Rank correlation (head delta ordering)\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"Allocation agreement (same bit-width)\", \"90.2%\"]\n          - [\"Cross-calib PPL gap\", \"0.13\"]\n          - [\"L0 8-bit protection consistent\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Scatter plot：WikiText-2 per-head delta (x-axis) vs C4 per-head delta (y-axis)，\n        112 个点，标注 Spearman ρ=0.94。L0 heads 用不同 marker 标注，\n        位于右上角，远离 cluster。\n    analysis: >\n      C4 实验完成了 \"multi-dataset\" 维度的验证。0.94 的 rank correlation 和 90.2%\n      的 allocation agreement 是强结果，支持论文的核心论点：per-head sensitivity\n      是 architectural property，calibration dataset 的选择不 critical。\n      Cross-calib PPL gap 仅 0.13 说明在实际部署中可以用任何 reasonable dataset\n      做 one-time calibration，不需要 task-specific profiling。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 算法，应用在我们的 discrete action set\n      {2,4,8,16}-bit 上（rounding to nearest）。在 Llama-3.1-8B 上与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      ratequant_continuous_optimal_bits: \"avg 4.0 (continuous)\"\n      ratequant_rounded_ppl: 8.12\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.78\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.95\n      ratequant_improvement_vs_uniform: 9.3\n      mckp_improvement_vs_uniform: 24.2\n      mckp_improvement_vs_ratequant: 16.5\n      ratequant_heads_at_2bit: 38\n      ratequant_l0_protection: \"partial (5/8 heads at 8-bit, 3 at 4-bit)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 假设 distortion D(b) = α·β^{-b} 是 continuous\n      且 additive 的。在 continuous regime 下这给出 R-D optimal allocation。但\n      rounding to discrete {2,4,8,16} 引入两个问题：\n      (1) Rounding loss：continuous 5.3-bit 被 round 到 4-bit 或 8-bit，两者都不是\n      optimal。MCKP 直接在 discrete space 上优化，避免了 rounding suboptimality。\n      (2) Compounding blindness：waterfilling 没有 cardinality constraint，round 后\n      38 个 heads 被分配 2-bit（vs MCKP 的 16 个），超过 compounding threshold。\n      这导致 PPL 8.12——比 uniform 好（9.3%）但远逊于 constrained MCKP（6.78）。\n      L0 保护不完整（仅 5/8 at 8-bit）是因为 waterfilling 的 continuous optimal\n      对 L0 的某些 heads 分配了 ~6-7 bit，round 到 4 或 8 取决于 arbitrary threshold。\n      16.5% 的 MCKP vs RateQuant 优势直接支撑论文的 core differentiation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RateQuant vs Constrained MCKP (Llama-3.1-8B)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Impr. vs Uniform\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"L0 at 8-bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"8.95\", \"—\", \"0\", \"0/8\"]\n          - [\"RateQuant (rounded)\", \"8.12\", \"9.3%\", \"38\", \"5/8\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"14.31\", \"−59.9%\", \"89\", \"8/8\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP\", \"6.78\", \"24.2%\", \"16\", \"8/8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Side-by-side allocation heatmaps (32×8)：RateQuant rounded vs Constrained MCKP。\n        标注 L0 row 差异（RateQuant 的 3 个 L0 heads 未被保护）和 2-bit 分布差异\n        （RateQuant 散布过多 2-bit heads）。\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文 differentiation 的实证基础。RateQuant 失败的两个原因清晰可分：\n      rounding loss 和 compounding blindness。论文可以构造一个 didactic example：\n      \"RateQuant assigns continuous 5.7 bits to L0-H3 (optimal under continuous\n      assumption), but rounding to 4-bit causes 4.2× more distortion than\n      rounding to 8-bit — a loss that MCKP avoids by directly optimizing in\n      discrete space.\" 结合 L0 partial protection failure，这给出了一个\n      compelling narrative：continuous methods fail at the granularity that matters.\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 4 个 layer groups（each 7 layers, 28 heads per group）上\n      brute-force enumerate 所有 allocation，计算 MCKP 与 true oracle 的 gap。\n    expected_results:\n      group_1_layers: \"L0-L6\"\n      group_1_mckp_ppl: 10.89\n      group_1_oracle_ppl: 10.82\n      group_1_gap: \"0.6%\"\n      group_2_layers: \"L7-L13\"\n      group_2_mckp_ppl: 11.01\n      group_2_oracle_ppl: 10.97\n      group_2_gap: \"0.4%\"\n      group_3_layers: \"L14-L20\"\n      group_3_mckp_ppl: 11.04\n      group_3_oracle_ppl: 11.02\n      group_3_gap: \"0.2%\"\n      group_4_layers: \"L21-L27\"\n      group_4_mckp_ppl: 10.98\n      group_4_oracle_ppl: 10.95\n      group_4_gap: \"0.3%\"\n      overall_estimated_gap: \"<1%\"\n      brute_force_configs_evaluated: \"4^28 per group ≈ 7.2×10^16 (sampled 10^6 + DP)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      MCKP 是 NP-hard in general，但我们的 instance 结构良好：(1) items (heads) 在\n      profiling delta 上有 clear separation（不是 adversarial instance），\n      (2) budget constraint 是 linear，(3) 每个 head 的 action set 只有 4 个选项。\n      在这种 \"benign\" instance 上，greedy-based MCKP solver（通过 LP relaxation +\n      rounding）接近 optimal。<1% 的 gap 说明 constrained MCKP 是 practically optimal，\n      不需要 exponential-time exact solver。Group 1（包含 L0）的 gap 最大（0.6%）\n      是因为 L0 heads 的 extreme delta 创造了更大的 \"opportunity cost\" gradient，\n      但即使如此 gap 也很小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: MCKP vs Oracle Gap\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"MCKP PPL\", \"Oracle PPL\", \"Gap (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L6\", \"10.89\", \"10.82\", \"0.6%\"]\n          - [\"L7-L13\", \"11.01\", \"10.97\", \"0.4%\"]\n          - [\"L14-L20\", \"11.04\", \"11.02\", \"0.2%\"]\n          - [\"L21-L27\", \"10.98\", \"10.95\", \"0.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart：每个 group 的 MCKP PPL vs Oracle PPL，gap 用 annotation 标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      <1% oracle gap 是一个 reassuring result。论文可以声明 \"our constrained MCKP\n      solver achieves near-optimal allocation\" 并用此实验作为 evidence。\n      这是 P1 priority，如果时间紧可以缩减到 2 个 groups。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      用 C4 calibrate profiling，在 WikiText-2 上评估（反向也做）。\n      报告 per-head allocation agreement rate。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_calib_wikitext_eval_ppl: 11.21\n      wikitext_calib_wikitext_eval_ppl: 11.08\n      wikitext_calib_c4_eval_ppl: 12.61\n      c4_calib_c4_eval_ppl: 12.48\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty: \"0.13 (WikiText), 0.13 (C4)\"\n      allocation_agreement: \"101/112 (90.2%)\"\n      disagreement_analysis: \"11 borderline mid-layer heads with delta ratio <1.5×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-head sensitivity 主要由 weight matrix 结构决定（architectural property），\n      calibration data 只影响 activation statistics 的 estimation。不同 domain 的\n      activation 分布在大模型中高度 overlap（因为 pretrain data 本身就是 multi-domain），\n      所以 calibration source 对 sensitivity ranking 的影响很小。\n      90.2% agreement 中不一致的 11 个 heads 都是 borderline cases——delta 接近\n      decision boundary 的 mid-layer heads，微小的 activation distribution shift\n      就足以翻转 4-bit vs 2-bit 的决策。但这些 heads 本身就是 \"doesn't matter much\"\n      的 heads（delta 很小），所以翻转对 PPL 影响极小（0.13 penalty）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Calibration Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"Calibration →\", \"Eval: WikiText-2\", \"Eval: C4\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"11.08\", \"12.61\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"11.21\", \"12.48\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"0.13\", \"0.13\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Confusion matrix 风格的 2×2 heatmap，cells 为 PPL 值，\n        diagonal 为 matched calibration，off-diagonal 为 cross-calibration。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration robustness 回答了一个 practical deployment question：\n      \"Do I need task-specific calibration data?\" 答案是 no——0.13 的 cross-calib\n      penalty 说明 any reasonable text corpus works。这简化了 deployment story。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成论文质量的 figures：per-head delta heatmap, compounding curve, allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      figure_1: \"Per-head profiling delta heatmap (28×4 for Qwen, 32×8 for Llama/Mistral)\"\n      figure_2: \"Compounding effect elbow curve (from plan_004)\"\n      figure_3: \"Budget allocation comparison bar charts (uniform vs MCKP at 3 compression ratios)\"\n      figure_4: \"Cross-model L0 dominance comparison\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这些 figures 直接对应论文的三条 claims：heatmap → Claim 1 (heterogeneity)，\n      allocation comparison → Claim 2 (MCKP superiority)，elbow curve → Claim 3\n      (cardinality regularization)。Cross-model figure 是 generalizability 的 visual proof。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (Paper Figure 2)：三模型 per-head delta heatmap 并排。\n        Log-scale colorbar。L0 row 用 box 标注。每个 heatmap 下方加\n        一个 marginal bar chart 显示 per-layer aggregated delta。\n      - >\n        Figure 2 (Paper Figure 1/Introduction)：Compounding elbow curve，\n        annotated with safe zone / compounding zone。\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (Paper Figure 3)：Grouped bar chart，三个 compression ratios，\n        每组三个 bars（uniform, unconstrained MCKP, constrained MCKP）。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (Paper Figure 4)：三模型 L0 delta vs rest-of-model delta\n        的 box plot，showing consistent 100× gap。\n    analysis: >\n      Figure 1 (compounding curve) 和 Figure 2 (heatmap) 是论文最重要的两张图。\n      建议 Figure 1 放在 Introduction，Figure 2 放在 Method section 的\n      motivation 段落。Figure 3 和 4 放在 Experiments section。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU / LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× compression 下评估 MMLU（5-shot）和 LongBench。\n      验证 PPL improvement 是否 transfer 到 downstream performance。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_fp16: 71.2\n      mmlu_uniform_4bit: 65.8\n      mmlu_constrained_mckp: 69.7\n      mmlu_improvement_pct: 5.9\n      longbench_fp16_avg: 48.3\n      longbench_uniform_4bit_avg: 39.1\n      longbench_constrained_mckp_avg: 45.8\n      longbench_improvement_pct: 17.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 主要测 short-context factual knowledge retrieval，KV cache quantization\n      对 MMLU 的影响相对较小（因为 sequence length 短，KV cache 的 cumulative error 小）。\n      所以 uniform 4-bit 的 MMLU 下降不大（65.8 vs 71.2, −7.6%），MCKP 的 improvement\n      也相应较小（+5.9 pp 的 recovery）。\n      LongBench 测 long-context tasks，KV cache quality 直接影响 long-range dependency\n      的保留。uniform 4-bit 下降更大（39.1 vs 48.3, −19.0%），MCKP 的 recovery 也更显著\n      （+17.1 pp）。这符合预期：mixed-precision KV cache 的价值在 long-context 场景下\n      最大，因为 cumulative quantization error 在长序列上被 amplified。\n      69.7 vs 71.2 的 MMLU（−2.1%）说明 constrained MCKP 在 4× 压缩下几乎无损。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream Task Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× Compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"FP16\", \"Uniform 4-bit\", \"Constrained MCKP\", \"Recovery %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (5-shot)\", \"71.2\", \"65.8\", \"69.7\", \"72.2%\"]\n          - [\"LongBench (avg)\", \"48.3\", \"39.1\", \"45.8\", \"72.8%\"]\n          - [\"WikiText-2 PPL ↓\", \"9.82\", \"15.45\", \"11.08\", \"77.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart 或 grouped bar chart：FP16 / Uniform / MCKP 在三个 metrics 上的对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream 结果确认 PPL improvement 不是 metric-hacking——实际 task performance\n      也显著提升。LongBench 的 17.1% improvement 特别有说服力，因为 KV cache 在\n      long-context 场景下是 critical bottleneck。论文可以用 \"72-78% of FP16-to-uniform\n      degradation recovered by constrained MCKP\" 作为 unified summary。\n      这是 P2，如果时间紧可以只做 MMLU（更快，更 standard benchmark）。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only (Scale Analysis)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上仅做 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 变化。\n    expected_results:\n      total_kv_heads: 560\n      layers: 80\n      kv_heads_per_layer: 7\n      l0_avg_delta: 3.47\n      l0_delta_ratio_vs_mean: \"142×\"\n      mid_layer_nonzero_pct: \"12.3% (lo-res)\"\n      top_sensitive_pct: \"2.8%\"\n      top_sensitive_contribution: \"74%\"\n      compounding_threshold_estimated_k: \"~20-30 (extrapolated)\"\n      profiling_time_hours: 3.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B model 有 80 layers × 7 KV heads = 560 KV heads。L0 dominance 更强（142× vs 100×）\n      是因为更深的 model 使得 L0 的 \"information gateway\" 角色更 critical——\n      所有下游 79 layers 都依赖 L0 产出的 representation。更大的 depth 意味着\n      L0 error 有更多 layers 来 accumulate。\n      Top sensitive heads 占比从 3.6%（7B）降到 2.8%（72B）是因为 heads 总数增加\n      但 critical heads 数量增加更慢（L0 的 7 heads + 少量 early-layer heads ≈ 15-16 heads）。\n      74% 的 contribution（vs 7B 的 70%）说明 concentration 进一步加剧。\n      这支持一个 scaling hypothesis：模型越大，sensitivity heterogeneity 越强，\n      mixed-precision 的 potential benefit 越大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Sensitivity Scaling (7B vs 72B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"Qwen2.5-72B\", \"Trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total KV heads\", \"112\", \"560\", \"5×\"]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"142×\", \"↑\"]\n          - [\"Top sensitive %\", \"3.6%\", \"2.8%\", \"↓ (more concentrated)\"]\n          - [\"Top contribution %\", \"70%\", \"74%\", \"↑\"]\n          - [\"Compounding threshold k\", \"8-12\", \"~20-30 (est.)\", \"scales sub-linearly\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        80×7 heatmap for 72B, side-by-side with 28×4 heatmap for 7B (same colorscale)。\n        Visual emphasis on increased sparsity of sensitive heads at larger scale。\n    analysis: >\n      70B profiling-only 是一个 \"scaling teaser\"——不做 full eval 但提供了 scale 维度的\n      evidence。142× L0 dominance 和 74% concentration 是 compelling numbers，\n      支持论文 Discussion 中的 \"as models scale, the potential benefit of per-head\n      mixed-precision allocation grows\" 论点。\n      P2 priority，如果时间紧可以放在 Appendix 或 Discussion 的一段话中。\n      不需要 full eval 就已经有足够的 narrative value。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10095,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10095},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6039cf4c-b780-40a8-9ffe-67b96920285d","uuid":"5822ff3d-9bfe-4d19-bcfe-e65377cf64b6"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":327767,"duration_api_ms":329111,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。三条 claims 在 Qwen/Llama/Mistral 三模型、WikiText-2/C4 双数据集上\n  完整成立。compounding effect 有干净的 elbow curve（SNR≥5），solver 在去掉 L0 exclusion 后\n  仍自动将 8-bit 分配给 Layer 0 heads。叙事核心：\"cardinality-constrained MCKP as principled\n  regularization for compounding effects\"。与 RateQuant 差异化清晰：discrete vs continuous +\n  compounding regularization 是 qualitatively different contribution。论文可以直接用\n  \"三模型一致性\"作为 generalizability 的强证据，用 compounding elbow curve 作为\n  cardinality constraint 的 principled motivation。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"L0 Auto-Discovery (No Exclusion)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      移除 solver 中的 L0 exclusion 硬约束，仅保留 max_2bit=8 的 cardinality constraint。\n      验证 solver 是否仅凭 profiling delta 数据自动将 8-bit 分配给 Layer 0 全部 4 个 KV heads。\n    expected_results:\n      l0_auto_discovery: true\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"4/4 (100%)\"\n      ppl_wikitext: 11.28\n      ppl_delta_vs_with_exclusion: +0.05\n      allocation_agreement_with_exclusion: \"108/112 heads identical (96.4%)\"\n      solver_time_seconds: 0.03\n    result_rationale: >\n      Layer 0 heads 的 profiling delta 比 mid-layer heads 高 ~100×（delta ≈ 2.1 vs 均值 0.02）。\n      在 MCKP 的 objective 中，将 L0 heads 从 4-bit 提升到 8-bit 的边际收益远超任何 mid-layer head，\n      因此即使没有 exclusion 硬约束，纯 cost-benefit optimization 也会自动选择保护 L0。\n      PPL 几乎不变（+0.05）是因为 solver 自由度增加后在 mid-layer 有微小重分配，但 L0 保护\n      这个核心决策完全一致。少数 4 个 head 的分配差异出现在 delta 接近的 mid-layer 边界 heads。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: L0 Head Allocation Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Delta (×10⁻²)\", \"With Exclusion\", \"Without Exclusion\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-H0\", \"215.3\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H1\", \"198.7\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H2\", \"201.4\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L0-H3\", \"189.2\", \"8-bit (forced)\", \"8-bit (auto)\"]\n          - [\"L1-H0\", \"3.41\", \"4-bit\", \"4-bit\"]\n          - [\"avg mid-layer\", \"1.87\", \"4-bit\", \"4-bit\"]\n      - name: \"Table: PPL Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Configuration\", \"PPL (WikiText-2)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (with L0 exclusion)\", \"11.23\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (without L0 exclusion)\", \"11.28\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"15.45\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: per-head bit-width allocation side-by-side (with vs without exclusion), color-coded by bit-width. Visual emphasis on L0 heads being identical in both conditions.\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文中最具叙事力的实验之一。它把 \"solver automatically discovers architectural\n      sensitivity structure\" 从修辞变成了实证。4/4 L0 heads 被自动发现说明 profiling delta\n      的 signal-to-noise 足够高，不需要任何领域先验。96.4% 的 allocation 一致率说明\n      exclusion constraint 本来就是冗余的——solver 自己就会做出正确决策。\n      PPL 差异 <0.5% 进一步确认了这一点。论文叙事可以正面使用：\n      \"We initially included L0 exclusion as a safety constraint, but found the solver\n      independently discovers L0 criticality from profiling data alone.\"\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Full Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B（GQA 4:1, 8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 KV heads）上\n      完整复现 pipeline：profiling → constrained MCKP → evaluation。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 6.24\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.95\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.78\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 14.31\n      ppl_improvement_pct: 24.2\n      max_2bit_used: 16\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"8/8 (100%)\"\n      heads_at_2bit: 16\n      heads_at_4bit: 192\n      heads_at_8bit: 32\n      heads_at_16bit: 16\n      compression_ratio: \"3.97×\"\n      top_sensitive_heads_pct: \"4.7%\"\n      top_sensitive_heads_ppl_contribution_pct: \"65%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的 GQA ratio 为 4:1（32 query heads / 8 KV heads），KV heads 数量是 Qwen 的\n      2.3 倍（256 vs 112）。更多的 heads 意味着 per-head 分配的自由度更高，MCKP 有更大的\n      优化空间。但 GQA 4:1 也意味着每个 KV head 被更少的 query heads 共享（4 vs 7），\n      所以单个 head 的影响力相对更分散，sensitivity heterogeneity 可能略低于 Qwen。\n      24.2% 的 PPL improvement 在 best tier 范围 [20,30] 内，略低于 Qwen 的 27% 是因为\n      Llama 的 attention head 结构更均匀（GQA ratio 更低→ per-KV-head 影响更分散）。\n      Unconstrained MCKP 仍然崩溃（14.31 vs 6.78）确认 compounding effect 在不同架构上一致存在，\n      但绝对恶化程度低于 Qwen（Qwen 36.92/11.23 = 3.3× vs Llama 14.31/6.78 = 2.1×），\n      因为 256 heads 中同时被分配 2-bit 的比例在相同 max_2bit 约束下更低。\n      L0 dominance pattern 复现：Layer 0 的 8 个 KV heads profiling delta 显著高于其他层。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Compression\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"Heads@8bit+\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 (baseline)\", \"6.24\", \"1×\", \"0\", \"256\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"8.95\", \"4×\", \"0\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"14.31\", \"4×\", \"89\", \"24\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (max_2bit=16)\", \"6.78\", \"4×\", \"16\", \"48\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Layer 0 Sensitivity (Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Delta (×10⁻²)\", \"Assigned\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-H0 ~ L0-H7\", \"58.3 ~ 89.1\", \"all 8-bit\"]\n          - [\"L1-H0 ~ L1-H7\", \"2.1 ~ 4.8\", \"mixed 4/8-bit\"]\n          - [\"avg mid-layer\", \"0.9\", \"4-bit\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 32×8 grid of per-head profiling delta for Llama-3.1-8B, showing L0 dominance and sparse mid-layer heterogeneity.\"\n      - \"Side-by-side allocation map: Qwen (28×4) vs Llama (32×8), demonstrating consistent L0 protection pattern across architectures.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 的成功复现是论文 generalizability 的关键支撑。GQA 4:1 vs 7:1 的差异\n      测试了方法对不同 KV head 共享结构的鲁棒性。24.2% 的改进虽然略低于 Qwen 的 27%，\n      但仍然显著且一致。unconstrained 崩溃的复现（2.1× 恶化）确认 compounding effect\n      不是 Qwen 特有的 artifact。跨架构 L0 dominance 的一致性支持 Claim 1 的强形式：\n      \"Layer 0 sensitivity is an architectural invariant, not a model-specific phenomenon.\"\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3 Full Pipeline\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      在 Mistral-7B-v0.3（GQA 4:1, 8 KV heads/layer × 32 layers = 256 KV heads，\n      sliding window attention）上完整复现 pipeline。\n    expected_results:\n      fp16_baseline_ppl: 7.01\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 9.87\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 7.68\n      unconstrained_mckp_ppl: 16.54\n      ppl_improvement_pct: 22.2\n      max_2bit_used: 14\n      l0_heads_assigned_8bit: \"8/8 (100%)\"\n      heads_at_2bit: 14\n      heads_at_4bit: 198\n      heads_at_8bit: 28\n      heads_at_16bit: 16\n      compression_ratio: \"3.98×\"\n      sliding_window_impact: \"window boundary layers show elevated sensitivity\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3 使用 sliding window attention（window=4096），这在 KV cache 的使用模式\n      上与 full attention 不同：window 边界附近的 layers 承担更多的\"信息中继\"职责，\n      sensitivity 分布可能比 Llama 更不均匀。22.2% 的 PPL improvement 在 best tier 范围\n      [18,28] 内，略低于 Llama 的 24.2%，因为 Mistral 的 sliding window 使得 KV cache\n      在长序列上的有效利用率本来就较高（无需缓存超出 window 的 KV），4-bit uniform\n      对 Mistral 的相对伤害比 full-attention 模型更小。但 constrained MCKP 仍然显著优于\n      uniform，确认方法在 sliding window 架构下同样有效。\n      L0 dominance pattern 第三次复现：即使有 sliding window，Layer 0 heads 仍然是最敏感的，\n      因为它们处理的是 token embedding 的直接变换，与 attention pattern 无关。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Mistral-7B Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Compression\", \"Improvement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16 (baseline)\", \"7.01\", \"1×\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"9.87\", \"4×\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"16.54\", \"4×\", \"−67.6%\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP\", \"7.68\", \"4×\", \"+22.2%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-head delta heatmap for Mistral, annotating sliding window boundary layers with elevated sensitivity.\"\n    analysis: >\n      三模型中最低的 PPL improvement（22.2%），但仍在 best tier 范围内。Sliding window\n      是一个有意义的 architectural variation，成功复现说明方法不依赖于 full attention 假设。\n      论文可以额外指出 sliding window boundary layers 的 elevated sensitivity 作为\n      一个 interesting observation，但不要过度解释。\n\n  - name: \"Compounding Effect Elbow Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上 sweep max_2bit 从 0 到 112（全部 KV heads），\n      8 个点：0, 4, 8, 16, 24, 48, 75, 112。绘制 PPL vs max_2bit 曲线，\n      定位 compounding threshold（elbow point）。\n    expected_results:\n      sweep_results:\n        max_2bit_0: {ppl: 12.01, heads_at_2bit: 0, note: \"no 2-bit allowed, solver uses 4/8/16 only\"}\n        max_2bit_4: {ppl: 11.34, heads_at_2bit: 4, note: \"4 most expendable heads at 2-bit, frees budget for 8-bit on L0\"}\n        max_2bit_8: {ppl: 11.08, heads_at_2bit: 8, note: \"near-optimal, all freed budget protecting critical heads\"}\n        max_2bit_16: {ppl: 11.52, heads_at_2bit: 16, note: \"slight degradation begins, compounding starts\"}\n        max_2bit_24: {ppl: 13.41, heads_at_2bit: 24, note: \"clear compounding, 2-bit heads interacting\"}\n        max_2bit_48: {ppl: 21.87, heads_at_2bit: 48, note: \"severe compounding, 43% of heads at extreme quant\"}\n        max_2bit_75: {ppl: 30.12, heads_at_2bit: 67, note: \"catastrophic, solver can't use all 75 slots optimally\"}\n        max_2bit_112: {ppl: 36.92, heads_at_2bit: 78, note: \"unconstrained equivalent, full compounding\"}\n      elbow_k: 12\n      elbow_snr: 7.3\n      optimal_k: 8\n      optimal_ppl: 11.08\n      pre_elbow_slope: 0.055\n      post_elbow_slope: 1.29\n    result_rationale: >\n      Compounding effect 的物理机制：当多个 heads 同时被 quantize 到 2-bit 时，每个 head 的\n      quantization error 通过 residual stream 传播到下游 layers。单个 head 的 2-bit error\n      可以被其他 head 的正常精度\"吸收\"，但当足够多的 heads 同时 degraded 时，error 累积\n      超过模型的 error correction capacity。这是一个典型的 threshold phenomenon。\n      elbow 在 k≈8-12 是因为 Qwen2.5-7B 有 112 个 KV heads（28 layers × 4 heads），\n      当 ~7-10% 的 heads 被设为 2-bit 时达到 compounding onset。k=8（7.1% of heads）\n      是 optimal：此时 freed budget 恰好足够保护所有 critical heads（L0 + 少量 high-delta\n      mid-layer heads）at 8/16-bit，而 2-bit heads 都是 truly expendable 的。\n      SNR=7.3 远超阈值 5，说明 elbow 是 sharp 的，不是 gradual degradation。\n      pre-elbow slope 0.055 PPL/head 说明在 safe region 内每增加一个 2-bit head 几乎\n      无影响；post-elbow slope 1.29 PPL/head 说明超过 elbow 后每增加一个 2-bit head\n      带来 >1 PPL 的恶化——23× 的 slope ratio 是 compounding non-additivity 的直接证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Compounding Effect Sweep\"\n        columns: [\"max_2bit (k)\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Δ PPL vs k=0\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"% Heads@2bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"12.01\", \"—\", \"0\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"4\", \"11.34\", \"−0.67\", \"4\", \"3.6%\"]\n          - [\"8\", \"11.08\", \"−0.93\", \"8\", \"7.1%\"]\n          - [\"16\", \"11.52\", \"−0.49\", \"16\", \"14.3%\"]\n          - [\"24\", \"13.41\", \"+1.40\", \"24\", \"21.4%\"]\n          - [\"48\", \"21.87\", \"+9.86\", \"48\", \"42.9%\"]\n          - [\"75\", \"30.12\", \"+18.11\", \"67\", \"59.8%\"]\n          - [\"112\", \"36.92\", \"+24.91\", \"78\", \"69.6%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        核心 Figure：PPL vs max_2bit (k) 曲线。X 轴为 max_2bit constraint value，\n        Y 轴为 PPL（log scale）。标注 elbow point (k=12) 和 optimal point (k=8)。\n        用灰色 band 标注 \"safe zone\" (k≤12) 和 \"compounding zone\" (k>12)。\n        右侧 y 轴叠加 Δ PPL per additional 2-bit head（local slope），\n        清晰展示 slope 在 elbow 处的 discontinuity。\n      - >\n        Inset figure：log-log plot of residual PPL increment vs k，\n        展示 pre-elbow region 为 sublinear（additive model valid）、\n        post-elbow region 为 superlinear（compounding dominates）。\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文的 signature figure，直接支撑 Claim 3。elbow curve 提供了 cardinality\n      constraint 的 principled justification：不是 arbitrary heuristic，而是\n      compounding non-additivity 的 empirical boundary。23× slope ratio 是一个\n      striking result，可以用一句话总结论文的核心发现：\n      \"Below the compounding threshold, per-head distortion is approximately additive\n      (slope=0.055); above it, each additional extreme-quantized head incurs 23× more\n      damage due to error propagation through the residual stream.\"\n      建议在论文 Introduction 的 Figure 1 位置放置此图。\n\n  - name: \"Budget Sweep (2×/4×/8× Compression)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上测试 constrained MCKP 在三个压缩比下的表现：\n      2×（budget=0.5）、4×（budget=0.25）、8×（budget=0.125），\n      每个压缩比与同 budget 的 uniform baseline 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      results_2x:\n        uniform_8bit_ppl: 10.12\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 9.94\n        improvement_pct: 1.8\n        allocation: \"mostly 8-bit with 12 heads at 16-bit, 8 heads at 4-bit\"\n      results_4x:\n        uniform_4bit_ppl: 15.45\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 11.08\n        improvement_pct: 28.3\n        allocation: \"8 heads@2bit, 76 heads@4bit, 20 heads@8bit, 8 heads@16bit\"\n      results_8x:\n        uniform_2bit_ppl: 78.34\n        constrained_mckp_ppl: 28.67\n        improvement_pct: 63.4\n        allocation: \"64 heads@2bit, 32 heads@4bit, 12 heads@8bit, 4 heads@16bit\"\n      fp16_baseline: 9.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      不同压缩比下 MCKP 优势的差异源于 sensitivity heterogeneity 的利用空间：\n      (1) 2× 压缩：budget 充裕，uniform 8-bit 已经接近 FP16（+3.1%），MCKP 只能通过\n      将少量 insensitive heads 降到 4-bit 并将 freed budget 给最 sensitive heads 升到\n      16-bit 来获得微小改进。1.8% 的 improvement 虽小但说明 heterogeneity 确实存在。\n      (2) 4× 压缩：sweet spot——uniform 4-bit 已有 57% 的 PPL degradation，而 MCKP\n      可以充分利用 head 间的 sensitivity 差异。28.3% 的 improvement 是 headline result。\n      (3) 8× 压缩：uniform 2-bit 是灾难性的（PPL 78.34, 8× baseline），MCKP 通过\n      保护 ~15% 的 critical heads 在 8/16-bit 将 PPL 控制在 28.67——仍然很差，\n      但比 uniform 好 63.4%。这说明即使在极端压缩下，intelligent allocation 仍然\n      有巨大价值，但也诚实地表明 8× 压缩的绝对质量不够实用。\n      整体趋势：MCKP 的相对优势随压缩比增加而增大，因为更激进的压缩放大了\n      sensitivity heterogeneity 的重要性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Budget Sweep Results (Qwen2.5-7B, WikiText-2)\"\n        columns: [\"Compression\", \"Budget\", \"Uniform PPL\", \"MCKP PPL\", \"Improvement\", \"Δ vs FP16\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2×\", \"0.50\", \"10.12\", \"9.94\", \"1.8%\", \"+1.2%\"]\n          - [\"4×\", \"0.25\", \"15.45\", \"11.08\", \"28.3%\", \"+12.8%\"]\n          - [\"8×\", \"0.125\", \"78.34\", \"28.67\", \"63.4%\", \"+192%\"]\n          - [\"FP16\", \"1.00\", \"9.82\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双 Y 轴图：左 Y 轴为 PPL（log scale），X 轴为 compression ratio，\n        两条线（uniform vs constrained MCKP）。右 Y 轴为 improvement percentage。\n        Fan-out pattern 清晰展示：压缩比越高，MCKP 优势越大。\n        标注 4× 为 \"practical sweet spot\"。\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sweep 回应了 reviewer concern #4（\"How does this work at different compression\n      ratios?\"）。1.8% → 28.3% → 63.4% 的递增趋势是一个 clean story：\n      mixed-precision 的价值在压缩压力大时最显著。4× 是论文的 headline compression ratio，\n      既是实际部署最常见的 target，也是 MCKP 优势最 striking 的 sweet spot。\n      8× 的结果可以诚实报告：MCKP 大幅优于 uniform 但绝对 PPL 仍然高，\n      说明方法的局限性（不能 violate information-theoretic limits）。\n\n  - name: \"High-Resolution Profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      将 profiling 从 16 seq × 512 tokens 提升到 64 seq × 2048 tokens（8× 数据量）。\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上重新 profile，rerun MCKP，评估是否能区分 mid-layer heads。\n    expected_results:\n      lores_nonzero_head_pct: 16.1\n      hires_nonzero_head_pct: 58.0\n      lores_delta_std_midlayers: 0.0003\n      hires_delta_std_midlayers: 0.0089\n      hires_mckp_ppl: 10.72\n      lores_mckp_ppl: 11.08\n      ppl_improvement_from_hires: 3.2\n      new_sensitive_heads_discovered: 14\n      l0_delta_change_pct: \"+2.1%\"\n      mid_layer_delta_change_pct: \"+1400%\"\n      profiling_time_hours: 2.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      低分辨率 profiling（16×512 = 8K tokens）的 mid-layer delta 被 sampling noise\n      淹没：大多数 mid-layer heads 的 true delta 在 10⁻⁴ 量级，而 sampling variance\n      在 ~10⁻³ 量级，导致 84% 的 heads 被 round 到 delta=0。高分辨率（64×2048 = 128K tokens）\n      将 sampling variance 降低 √16 ≈ 4×，使得 10⁻⁴ 量级的 true delta 开始可分辨。\n      58% nonzero（从 16.1% 提升）意味着约 47 个之前被认为 delta=0 的 head 现在有了\n      可测量的 sensitivity signal。其中 14 个 head 的 delta 足够大以改变 MCKP allocation。\n      3.2% 的 PPL improvement（10.72 vs 11.08）说明 mid-layer heterogeneity 确实存在且\n      有实际价值，但主要贡献仍来自 L0 的 correct allocation（L0 delta 变化仅 2.1%，\n      说明 L0 signal 在低分辨率下就已经 saturated）。\n      1400% 的 mid-layer delta std 提升是最 striking 的数字：\n      从 0.0003 到 0.0089，说明 mid-layer 内部确实有显著的 head-level heterogeneity，\n      只是之前被 noise 掩盖了。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Profiling Resolution Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Lo-Res (16×512)\", \"Hi-Res (64×2048)\", \"Change\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total profiling tokens\", \"8,192\", \"131,072\", \"16×\"]\n          - [\"Nonzero-delta heads\", \"18/112 (16.1%)\", \"65/112 (58.0%)\", \"+261%\"]\n          - [\"Mid-layer delta std\", \"3×10⁻⁴\", \"8.9×10⁻³\", \"+1400%\"]\n          - [\"L0 avg delta\", \"2.08\", \"2.12\", \"+2.1%\"]\n          - [\"MCKP PPL\", \"11.08\", \"10.72\", \"−3.2%\"]\n          - [\"Allocation changes vs lo-res\", \"—\", \"14 heads\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Profiling wall-time\", \"0.4h\", \"2.8h\", \"7×\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Discovered Mid-Layer Sensitive Heads\"\n        columns: [\"Head\", \"Lo-Res Delta\", \"Hi-Res Delta\", \"New Allocation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L12-H2\", \"0.000\", \"0.0134\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L15-H0\", \"0.000\", \"0.0118\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L7-H3\", \"0.000\", \"0.0097\", \"4→8 bit\"]\n          - [\"L21-H1\", \"0.000\", \"0.0091\", \"2→4 bit\"]\n          - [\"... (10 more)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        双面板 heatmap：左为 lo-res delta（28×4 grid，大量 white=0），\n        右为 hi-res delta（同 grid，明显更多 non-zero entries，color gradient\n        揭示 mid-layer heterogeneity）。共享 colorbar（log scale）。\n      - >\n        Histogram：lo-res vs hi-res delta 分布，展示 hi-res 下 delta=0 的\n        spike 大幅缩小，被一个 continuous distribution 取代。\n    analysis: >\n      高分辨率 profiling 的 3.2% PPL improvement 不大，但它的主要价值是 scientific：\n      证明了 mid-layer heterogeneity 的存在（之前被 noise 掩盖），使 Claim 1\n      从 \"L0 dominates\" 扩展为 \"sensitivity is hierarchically structured —\n      L0 dominates, but mid-layer heterogeneity also matters at finer resolution\"。\n      论文建议：hi-res profiling 可以作为一个 optional enhancement，\n      main results 使用 lo-res（更实用），hi-res 在 analysis section 展示\n      以支持 Claim 1 的完整叙事。2.8h 的 profiling 成本说明 hi-res 在实践中\n      不是 free 的，但对于 one-time offline allocation 是可接受的。\n\n  - name: \"C4 Cross-Dataset Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 上用 WikiText-2 calibrated allocations 在 C4 上评估，\n      同时用 C4 数据 rerun profiling + MCKP 并在 C4 上评估。\n      计算两种 allocation 的 rank correlation。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_fp16_ppl: 11.87\n      c4_uniform_4bit_ppl: 17.42\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl_wikitext_calib: 12.61\n      c4_constrained_mckp_ppl_c4_calib: 12.48\n      c4_ppl_improvement_pct: 27.6\n      wikitext_c4_rank_correlation: 0.94\n      allocation_agreement_rate: \"101/112 heads (90.2%)\"\n      l0_protection_consistent: true\n      cross_calib_ppl_gap: 0.13\n    result_rationale: >\n      C4 是 web-crawl 数据，domain 比 WikiText-2 更广。PPL 绝对值更高（FP16 11.87 vs 9.82）\n      是因为 C4 的 vocabulary diversity 和 noise。但 quantization sensitivity 的 relative\n      ordering 高度一致（rank correlation 0.94）：哪些 heads 敏感、哪些不敏感，\n      这是 architectural property 而非 data-dependent property。L0 heads 在 C4 profiling\n      下同样是最敏感的，进一步支持 \"sensitivity is architecturally determined\"。\n      90.2% 的 allocation agreement 说明 WikiText-2 calibrated allocation 在 C4 上\n      几乎同样有效（PPL gap 仅 0.13）。27.6% 的 improvement 与 WikiText-2 上的 28.3%\n      接近，说明方法的效果不依赖于特定 dataset。\n      0.94 的 rank correlation 在 best tier 范围 [0.88, 0.98] 内。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: C4 Evaluation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"WikiText-2 PPL\", \"C4 PPL\", \"Improvement\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FP16\", \"9.82\", \"11.87\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"15.45\", \"17.42\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (WT2-calib)\", \"11.08\", \"12.61\", \"27.6%\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP (C4-calib)\", \"—\", \"12.48\", \"28.3%\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"36.92\", \"41.23\", \"−136.5%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Dataset Calibration Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Rank correlation (head delta ordering)\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"Allocation agreement (same bit-width)\", \"90.2%\"]\n          - [\"Cross-calib PPL gap\", \"0.13\"]\n          - [\"L0 8-bit protection consistent\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Scatter plot：WikiText-2 per-head delta (x-axis) vs C4 per-head delta (y-axis)，\n        112 个点，标注 Spearman ρ=0.94。L0 heads 用不同 marker 标注，\n        位于右上角，远离 cluster。\n    analysis: >\n      C4 实验完成了 \"multi-dataset\" 维度的验证。0.94 的 rank correlation 和 90.2%\n      的 allocation agreement 是强结果，支持论文的核心论点：per-head sensitivity\n      是 architectural property，calibration dataset 的选择不 critical。\n      Cross-calib PPL gap 仅 0.13 说明在实际部署中可以用任何 reasonable dataset\n      做 one-time calibration，不需要 task-specific profiling。\n\n  - name: \"RateQuant Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      实现 RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 算法，应用在我们的 discrete action set\n      {2,4,8,16}-bit 上（rounding to nearest）。在 Llama-3.1-8B 上与 constrained MCKP 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      ratequant_continuous_optimal_bits: \"avg 4.0 (continuous)\"\n      ratequant_rounded_ppl: 8.12\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 6.78\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 8.95\n      ratequant_improvement_vs_uniform: 9.3\n      mckp_improvement_vs_uniform: 24.2\n      mckp_improvement_vs_ratequant: 16.5\n      ratequant_heads_at_2bit: 38\n      ratequant_l0_protection: \"partial (5/8 heads at 8-bit, 3 at 4-bit)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      RateQuant 的 reverse waterfilling 假设 distortion D(b) = α·β^{-b} 是 continuous\n      且 additive 的。在 continuous regime 下这给出 R-D optimal allocation。但\n      rounding to discrete {2,4,8,16} 引入两个问题：\n      (1) Rounding loss：continuous 5.3-bit 被 round 到 4-bit 或 8-bit，两者都不是\n      optimal。MCKP 直接在 discrete space 上优化，避免了 rounding suboptimality。\n      (2) Compounding blindness：waterfilling 没有 cardinality constraint，round 后\n      38 个 heads 被分配 2-bit（vs MCKP 的 16 个），超过 compounding threshold。\n      这导致 PPL 8.12——比 uniform 好（9.3%）但远逊于 constrained MCKP（6.78）。\n      L0 保护不完整（仅 5/8 at 8-bit）是因为 waterfilling 的 continuous optimal\n      对 L0 的某些 heads 分配了 ~6-7 bit，round 到 4 或 8 取决于 arbitrary threshold。\n      16.5% 的 MCKP vs RateQuant 优势直接支撑论文的 core differentiation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RateQuant vs Constrained MCKP (Llama-3.1-8B)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"PPL ↓\", \"Impr. vs Uniform\", \"Heads@2bit\", \"L0 at 8-bit\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Uniform 4-bit\", \"8.95\", \"—\", \"0\", \"0/8\"]\n          - [\"RateQuant (rounded)\", \"8.12\", \"9.3%\", \"38\", \"5/8\"]\n          - [\"Unconstrained MCKP\", \"14.31\", \"−59.9%\", \"89\", \"8/8\"]\n          - [\"Constrained MCKP\", \"6.78\", \"24.2%\", \"16\", \"8/8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Side-by-side allocation heatmaps (32×8)：RateQuant rounded vs Constrained MCKP。\n        标注 L0 row 差异（RateQuant 的 3 个 L0 heads 未被保护）和 2-bit 分布差异\n        （RateQuant 散布过多 2-bit heads）。\n    analysis: >\n      这是论文 differentiation 的实证基础。RateQuant 失败的两个原因清晰可分：\n      rounding loss 和 compounding blindness。论文可以构造一个 didactic example：\n      \"RateQuant assigns continuous 5.7 bits to L0-H3 (optimal under continuous\n      assumption), but rounding to 4-bit causes 4.2× more distortion than\n      rounding to 8-bit — a loss that MCKP avoids by directly optimizing in\n      discrete space.\" 结合 L0 partial protection failure，这给出了一个\n      compelling narrative：continuous methods fail at the granularity that matters.\n\n  - name: \"Oracle Comparison (Subset Brute-Force)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 的 4 个 layer groups（each 7 layers, 28 heads per group）上\n      brute-force enumerate 所有 allocation，计算 MCKP 与 true oracle 的 gap。\n    expected_results:\n      group_1_layers: \"L0-L6\"\n      group_1_mckp_ppl: 10.89\n      group_1_oracle_ppl: 10.82\n      group_1_gap: \"0.6%\"\n      group_2_layers: \"L7-L13\"\n      group_2_mckp_ppl: 11.01\n      group_2_oracle_ppl: 10.97\n      group_2_gap: \"0.4%\"\n      group_3_layers: \"L14-L20\"\n      group_3_mckp_ppl: 11.04\n      group_3_oracle_ppl: 11.02\n      group_3_gap: \"0.2%\"\n      group_4_layers: \"L21-L27\"\n      group_4_mckp_ppl: 10.98\n      group_4_oracle_ppl: 10.95\n      group_4_gap: \"0.3%\"\n      overall_estimated_gap: \"<1%\"\n      brute_force_configs_evaluated: \"4^28 per group ≈ 7.2×10^16 (sampled 10^6 + DP)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      MCKP 是 NP-hard in general，但我们的 instance 结构良好：(1) items (heads) 在\n      profiling delta 上有 clear separation（不是 adversarial instance），\n      (2) budget constraint 是 linear，(3) 每个 head 的 action set 只有 4 个选项。\n      在这种 \"benign\" instance 上，greedy-based MCKP solver（通过 LP relaxation +\n      rounding）接近 optimal。<1% 的 gap 说明 constrained MCKP 是 practically optimal，\n      不需要 exponential-time exact solver。Group 1（包含 L0）的 gap 最大（0.6%）\n      是因为 L0 heads 的 extreme delta 创造了更大的 \"opportunity cost\" gradient，\n      但即使如此 gap 也很小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: MCKP vs Oracle Gap\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"MCKP PPL\", \"Oracle PPL\", \"Gap (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L6\", \"10.89\", \"10.82\", \"0.6%\"]\n          - [\"L7-L13\", \"11.01\", \"10.97\", \"0.4%\"]\n          - [\"L14-L20\", \"11.04\", \"11.02\", \"0.2%\"]\n          - [\"L21-L27\", \"10.98\", \"10.95\", \"0.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart：每个 group 的 MCKP PPL vs Oracle PPL，gap 用 annotation 标注。\"\n    analysis: >\n      <1% oracle gap 是一个 reassuring result。论文可以声明 \"our constrained MCKP\n      solver achieves near-optimal allocation\" 并用此实验作为 evidence。\n      这是 P1 priority，如果时间紧可以缩减到 2 个 groups。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Domain Calibration Robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      用 C4 calibrate profiling，在 WikiText-2 上评估（反向也做）。\n      报告 per-head allocation agreement rate。\n    expected_results:\n      c4_calib_wikitext_eval_ppl: 11.21\n      wikitext_calib_wikitext_eval_ppl: 11.08\n      wikitext_calib_c4_eval_ppl: 12.61\n      c4_calib_c4_eval_ppl: 12.48\n      cross_calib_ppl_penalty: \"0.13 (WikiText), 0.13 (C4)\"\n      allocation_agreement: \"101/112 (90.2%)\"\n      disagreement_analysis: \"11 borderline mid-layer heads with delta ratio <1.5×\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-head sensitivity 主要由 weight matrix 结构决定（architectural property），\n      calibration data 只影响 activation statistics 的 estimation。不同 domain 的\n      activation 分布在大模型中高度 overlap（因为 pretrain data 本身就是 multi-domain），\n      所以 calibration source 对 sensitivity ranking 的影响很小。\n      90.2% agreement 中不一致的 11 个 heads 都是 borderline cases——delta 接近\n      decision boundary 的 mid-layer heads，微小的 activation distribution shift\n      就足以翻转 4-bit vs 2-bit 的决策。但这些 heads 本身就是 \"doesn't matter much\"\n      的 heads（delta 很小），所以翻转对 PPL 影响极小（0.13 penalty）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Calibration Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"Calibration →\", \"Eval: WikiText-2\", \"Eval: C4\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"WikiText-2\", \"11.08\", \"12.61\"]\n          - [\"C4\", \"11.21\", \"12.48\"]\n          - [\"Gap\", \"0.13\", \"0.13\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Confusion matrix 风格的 2×2 heatmap，cells 为 PPL 值，\n        diagonal 为 matched calibration，off-diagonal 为 cross-calibration。\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-calibration robustness 回答了一个 practical deployment question：\n      \"Do I need task-specific calibration data?\" 答案是 no——0.13 的 cross-calib\n      penalty 说明 any reasonable text corpus works。这简化了 deployment story。\n\n  - name: \"Head Sensitivity Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      生成论文质量的 figures：per-head delta heatmap, compounding curve, allocation comparison。\n    expected_results:\n      figures_generated: 4\n      figure_1: \"Per-head profiling delta heatmap (28×4 for Qwen, 32×8 for Llama/Mistral)\"\n      figure_2: \"Compounding effect elbow curve (from plan_004)\"\n      figure_3: \"Budget allocation comparison bar charts (uniform vs MCKP at 3 compression ratios)\"\n      figure_4: \"Cross-model L0 dominance comparison\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      这些 figures 直接对应论文的三条 claims：heatmap → Claim 1 (heterogeneity)，\n      allocation comparison → Claim 2 (MCKP superiority)，elbow curve → Claim 3\n      (cardinality regularization)。Cross-model figure 是 generalizability 的 visual proof。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Figure 1 (Paper Figure 2)：三模型 per-head delta heatmap 并排。\n        Log-scale colorbar。L0 row 用 box 标注。每个 heatmap 下方加\n        一个 marginal bar chart 显示 per-layer aggregated delta。\n      - >\n        Figure 2 (Paper Figure 1/Introduction)：Compounding elbow curve，\n        annotated with safe zone / compounding zone。\n      - >\n        Figure 3 (Paper Figure 3)：Grouped bar chart，三个 compression ratios，\n        每组三个 bars（uniform, unconstrained MCKP, constrained MCKP）。\n      - >\n        Figure 4 (Paper Figure 4)：三模型 L0 delta vs rest-of-model delta\n        的 box plot，showing consistent 100× gap。\n    analysis: >\n      Figure 1 (compounding curve) 和 Figure 2 (heatmap) 是论文最重要的两张图。\n      建议 Figure 1 放在 Introduction，Figure 2 放在 Method section 的\n      motivation 段落。Figure 3 和 4 放在 Experiments section。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Evaluation (MMLU / LongBench)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-7B 4× compression 下评估 MMLU（5-shot）和 LongBench。\n      验证 PPL improvement 是否 transfer 到 downstream performance。\n    expected_results:\n      mmlu_fp16: 71.2\n      mmlu_uniform_4bit: 65.8\n      mmlu_constrained_mckp: 69.7\n      mmlu_improvement_pct: 5.9\n      longbench_fp16_avg: 48.3\n      longbench_uniform_4bit_avg: 39.1\n      longbench_constrained_mckp_avg: 45.8\n      longbench_improvement_pct: 17.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      MMLU 主要测 short-context factual knowledge retrieval，KV cache quantization\n      对 MMLU 的影响相对较小（因为 sequence length 短，KV cache 的 cumulative error 小）。\n      所以 uniform 4-bit 的 MMLU 下降不大（65.8 vs 71.2, −7.6%），MCKP 的 improvement\n      也相应较小（+5.9 pp 的 recovery）。\n      LongBench 测 long-context tasks，KV cache quality 直接影响 long-range dependency\n      的保留。uniform 4-bit 下降更大（39.1 vs 48.3, −19.0%），MCKP 的 recovery 也更显著\n      （+17.1 pp）。这符合预期：mixed-precision KV cache 的价值在 long-context 场景下\n      最大，因为 cumulative quantization error 在长序列上被 amplified。\n      69.7 vs 71.2 的 MMLU（−2.1%）说明 constrained MCKP 在 4× 压缩下几乎无损。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Downstream Task Results (Qwen2.5-7B, 4× Compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"FP16\", \"Uniform 4-bit\", \"Constrained MCKP\", \"Recovery %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"MMLU (5-shot)\", \"71.2\", \"65.8\", \"69.7\", \"72.2%\"]\n          - [\"LongBench (avg)\", \"48.3\", \"39.1\", \"45.8\", \"72.8%\"]\n          - [\"WikiText-2 PPL ↓\", \"9.82\", \"15.45\", \"11.08\", \"77.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart 或 grouped bar chart：FP16 / Uniform / MCKP 在三个 metrics 上的对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream 结果确认 PPL improvement 不是 metric-hacking——实际 task performance\n      也显著提升。LongBench 的 17.1% improvement 特别有说服力，因为 KV cache 在\n      long-context 场景下是 critical bottleneck。论文可以用 \"72-78% of FP16-to-uniform\n      degradation recovered by constrained MCKP\" 作为 unified summary。\n      这是 P2，如果时间紧可以只做 MMLU（更快，更 standard benchmark）。\n\n  - name: \"70B Profiling-Only (Scale Analysis)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Qwen2.5-72B 上仅做 distortion profiling（不做 full eval），\n      分析 sensitivity patterns 是否随 model size 变化。\n    expected_results:\n      total_kv_heads: 560\n      layers: 80\n      kv_heads_per_layer: 7\n      l0_avg_delta: 3.47\n      l0_delta_ratio_vs_mean: \"142×\"\n      mid_layer_nonzero_pct: \"12.3% (lo-res)\"\n      top_sensitive_pct: \"2.8%\"\n      top_sensitive_contribution: \"74%\"\n      compounding_threshold_estimated_k: \"~20-30 (extrapolated)\"\n      profiling_time_hours: 3.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      72B model 有 80 layers × 7 KV heads = 560 KV heads。L0 dominance 更强（142× vs 100×）\n      是因为更深的 model 使得 L0 的 \"information gateway\" 角色更 critical——\n      所有下游 79 layers 都依赖 L0 产出的 representation。更大的 depth 意味着\n      L0 error 有更多 layers 来 accumulate。\n      Top sensitive heads 占比从 3.6%（7B）降到 2.8%（72B）是因为 heads 总数增加\n      但 critical heads 数量增加更慢（L0 的 7 heads + 少量 early-layer heads ≈ 15-16 heads）。\n      74% 的 contribution（vs 7B 的 70%）说明 concentration 进一步加剧。\n      这支持一个 scaling hypothesis：模型越大，sensitivity heterogeneity 越强，\n      mixed-precision 的 potential benefit 越大。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Sensitivity Scaling (7B vs 72B)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen2.5-7B\", \"Qwen2.5-72B\", \"Trend\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Total KV heads\", \"112\", \"560\", \"5×\"]\n          - [\"L0 delta ratio\", \"100×\", \"142×\", \"↑\"]\n          - [\"Top sensitive %\", \"3.6%\", \"2.8%\", \"↓ (more concentrated)\"]\n          - [\"Top contribution %\", \"70%\", \"74%\", \"↑\"]\n          - [\"Compounding threshold k\", \"8-12\", \"~20-30 (est.)\", \"scales sub-linearly\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        80×7 heatmap for 72B, side-by-side with 28×4 heatmap for 7B (same colorscale)。\n        Visual emphasis on increased sparsity of sensitive heads at larger scale。\n    analysis: >\n      70B profiling-only 是一个 \"scaling teaser\"——不做 full eval 但提供了 scale 维度的\n      evidence。142× L0 dominance 和 74% concentration 是 compelling numbers，\n      支持论文 Discussion 中的 \"as models scale, the potential benefit of per-head\n      mixed-precision allocation grows\" 论点。\n      P2 priority，如果时间紧可以放在 Appendix 或 Discussion 的一段话中。\n      不需要 full eval 就已经有足够的 narrative value。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6039cf4c-b780-40a8-9ffe-67b96920285d","total_cost_usd":0.51778825,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10095,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":17743,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10095,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17743,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10095,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10095},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5054,"outputTokens":27,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005189,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":17743,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10095,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.51259925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"61343659-799e-4fed-b1d0-6a49b58949cf"}
